node_modules/
# Every build output, not four named ones. `dist-audit/` and `dist-dbg/` were
# committed for weeks under the old list -- 24 files of shells, manifests,
# service workers, fonts and icons -- and `git status` looked clean only because
# the blanket `bundle.js` rule hid the bundles inside them. That is repo weight
# today and a credential leak tomorrow: apps/bench/build.mjs writes
# `const SHARED_SUPABASE = {...}` into its index.html, and tools/config.mjs
# blanking a secret key at build time does nothing about git history.
dist*/
bundle.js
# Scratch: *.tmp.mjs is the convention for a throwaway probe.
*.tmp.mjs
shots/
qrshots/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
site/
